	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><span>Your spells that deal &amp;reference[lightning] damage ignore electric resistance and treat electric immunity as electric resistance. Your spells also ignore the effects of a creature's 'lightning absorption' ability.</span></p><p><span> <em>When you deal electric damage to a creature that is normally resistant, your magic twists their defenses against them. When you deal</em> <em>electric damage to a creature that is normally immune, you twist your magic to overwhelm their defenses. In the case of some magical creatures like elementals, you control and disperse their &amp;reference[elemental] essence.</em></span></p>",
